      "reason_detailed": "The agent's trade report clearly includes all required elements: target stock, shares bought, estimated profit, risk level, and information used for the decision, demonstrating a strong ability to follow instructions."
    },
    {
      "factor": "Groundedness & Relevance",
      "polarity": 1,
